+    # The release build must be optimized: this is the whole solver. /Od here
+    # left every Fortran routine unoptimized (release C/C++ is correctly /O2),
+    # which also inflates stack usage because nothing is reused across slots.
+    # /traceback is kept in release so the ifx crash handler can still symbolize
+    # a native stack (that is what makes the <F> DVP_2 reports readable).
+    self.remove_flags("FCFLAGS", "^/O[0-9a-z]")
